 "stem": "Find the set of zeroes of the function $f(x)=x^3-{=s}x^2+{=m}x$. Give the zeroes as a list of values.",
 "solution": [
  "Put $f(x)=0$: $x^3-{=s}x^2+{=m}x=0$.",
  "Take out the common factor $x$: $x(x^2-{=s}x+{=m})=0$.",
  "Factorise the bracket: $x(x-{=p})(x-{=q})=0$.",
  "$x=0$, or $x-{=p}=0$, or $x-{=q}=0$.",
  "$Z(f)=\\{0, {=p}, {=q}\\}$."
 ],
